gs to grisha an interesting  detail is that there are clouds in the  background to represent the paradise  this family had before grisha showed up  and the background changes to red to  represent him killing them it then  switches to different fragments from  aaron's past including an image of  captain levi sasha and connie messing  around when they were in the cadets and  falco coming to eren for advice when he  was undercover in mali one of the  easiest memories to miss though was this  one that belonged to kruger and this  showed up right after falco's appearance  although the anime brushes passed it  super quickly this memory was a lot  clearer in the manga version and it's of  the moment when krueger's parents and  sister were about to be set on fire as  he explained in his backstory his dad  was one of the original alden  restorationists and because of that  connection his family were killed by  marley while he could only watch on from  his hiding place in the closet the next  scene then gives us a stylized version  of berto's colossal titan appearing in  front of bulmaria before moving on to  what can only be described as reiner and  levi and some other guys in a sauna this  is a reference to the alternate cover  for volume 31 of the manga although why  it appears in eren's memories is a bit  of a mystery if if we assume that  something like this did actually happen  then i'm just having a hard time  figuring out where it fits on the  timeline since levi had no reason to  relax with these guys when they were  cadets and after they graduated i just  don't i don't really see levi being in a  sauna with reiner specifically that  being said it's clearly here for a  reason so i mean maybe i've missed  something so if you have a good idea of  what this is about then do let me know  in the comments below  up next we get a brief vision of ramsay  who is a character that hasn't been  introduced in the anime yet but without  getting into spoilers this boy is  someone w