nt as the camera zooms in to  show a bright flash of white light which  turns out to be the coordinate the  coordinate is where the paths connecting  all ldns converge into one and from this  place all subjects of emir are connected  through these parts the various memories  of every subject can be accessed and if  the founding titan wants to she can  manipulate the coordinate to alter the  bodies and minds of these aliens as well  anyhow after aaron's memory slideshow is  finished he manifests directly in front  of it in the past dimension while hobo  zeke is chained up behind him the reason  zeke's hair is longer than normal is  because time passes differently in this  reality and from his perspective it felt  like years until aaron arrived due to  the large amount of time he spent  trapped here alone he began to learn  various things about the founder  including the fact that the sand they're  standing on can be used by amir to  create anything  not only did she use it to rebuild his  body from scratch a couple episodes ago  but for the last two thousand years  she's been in here moulding titans from  scratch whenever someone needed their  power  now in order to explain how zeke got the  upper hand against aaron it's first  important to understand how the founding  titan actually works  to put it simply anything the founding  titan does or anything the founding  titan can do is because the emir is in  the past dimension making it happen so  essentially if you control your mirror  then you control the founder  historically speaking those who've  possessed the coordinate inside them  have always had royal blood so they had  no problem accessing the past dimension  and telling yamir what to do  in aaron's case though since he's a  regular eldian he needed the assistance  of zeke to get here and now that they're  both here ymir gives zeke priority due  to his royal blood  unlike the rice family he's arrived in  parts without actually having the  coordinate inside him and therefore he  hasn't been tated by the vow to announce  war which only affects royals who have  the founding titan for that reason he's  free to command yamir to do literally  anything he wants hence why he made her  create these chains his goal was to make  aaron believe that he'd been trapped by  the voucher announced war and in this  way he could test if aaron was really on  his side when it came down to it aaron  did take the bait and refused to use him  his powers for the euthanization plan  proving in zeke's mind that his  suspicion was correct and his brother  had been brainwashed by their father  remember ever since zeke found out that  he had a younger brother he assumed that  they'd both been brainwashed to become  alien restorationists from his  perspective it was sarva that saved him  from this mindset and now here in this  scene he wants to be the person to save  aaron the first time they met zeke even  promised that one day he would do this  so this encounter in the past dimension  is really just them coming full circle  by commanding emir zeke uses the  founder's power to restrict aaron in  these chains and his goal is to convince  his brother to join him in saving the  world of course his version of saving  the world means sterilizing every aldian  so it will be interesting to see how he  tries to convince aaron to do that in  the next episode  anyway people that was my breakdown for  episode 19 of attack on titan season 4  but one thing i quickly wanted to  mention was the reason falco disobeyed  the beast titan's order and went after  porco i didn't find the right moment to  talk about this earlier but essentially  in the beginning he follows these  instructions to go after reiner but at  the last second he abandoned that  objective to go after galliard an  explanation for this is that although he  was given orders sometimes titan  instincts can take priority and we've  seen that happen before with this titan  back in season 2. therefore falco  choosing to go after galileo does make  sense since pogo was completely out in  the open ready to be eaten whereas rhino  was still protected by this layer of  armor on top of that a few minutes had  passed and zeke gave the original  instruction so you know it's feasible  that after a while the will to follow a  certain task can be more easily  forgotten those are just my thoughts in  it but let me know your opinion in the  comments down below and don't forget to  hit that sub button if you want to see  more videos like this  until the next one peace out

